          "snippet": {
            "text": "/-- The value of the L-series of the sequence `f` at the point `s`\nif it converges absolutely there, and `0` otherwise. -/\nnoncomputable\ndef LSeries (f : ℕ → ℂ) (s : ℂ) : ℂ :=\n  ∑' n, term f s n",
            "line": 161,
            "truncated": false
          },
          "proof_context": {
            "declaration": "LSeries",
            "lines": [
              161,
              165
            ],
            "conclusion": "`LSeries f s = Σ' n, term f s n`, with `term f s n = f n / n^s` for `n ≠ 0` and `0` at `n = 0`: the Dirichlet series `Σ_{n≥1} f(n) n^{-s}`."
          },
